@model RadaTik.Areas.CompanyAdmin.ViewModels.MoneyDiaryIndexViewModel
@using RadaTik.Helpers
@using RadaTik.Models.Business
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "دفتر الإيراد والمصروف";
    var companyName = ViewBag.CompanyName as string ?? "";
    var monthNames = new[] { "", "يناير", "فبراير", "مارس", "أبريل", "مايو", "يونيو", "يوليو", "أغسطس", "سبتمبر", "أكتوبر", "نوفمبر", "ديسمبر" };
}

<div class="page-header mb-3">
    <h1 class="page-title"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> @ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">@companyName — @monthNames[Model.Month] @Model.Year</p>
</div>

<div class="d-flex gap-2 mb-3">
    <form method="get" asp-action="Index" class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-end">
        <input type="number" name="year" class="form-control form-control-sm" value="@Model.Year" style="width:5rem" />
        <select name="month" class="form-select form-select-sm">
            @for (int i = 1; i <= 12; i++)
            {
                if (i == Model.Month) { <option value="@i" selected>@monthNames[i]</option> }
                else { <option value="@i">@monthNames[i]</option> }
            }
        </select>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">عرض</button>
    </form>
</div>

<div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-md-3"><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><div class="small text-muted">إيراد ل.س.ج</div><div class="fw-bold text-success">@Model.TotalIncomeSyp.ToString("N0")</div></div></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-3"><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><div class="small text-muted">مصروف ل.س.ج</div><div class="fw-bold text-danger">@Model.TotalExpenseSyp.ToString("N0")</div></div></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-3"><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><div class="small text-muted">صافي ل.س.ج</div><div class="fw-bold">@Model.NetSyp.ToString("N0")</div></div></div></div>
</div>

<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-sm mb-0 radtk-data-table radtk-data-table--cards">
            <thead><tr><th>التاريخ</th><th>النوع</th><th>المبلغ</th><th>الوصف</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            @if (!Model.Entries.Any()) { <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-center text-muted py-3">لا توجد قيود.</td></tr> }
            @foreach (var e in Model.Entries)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td>@e.EntryDate.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")</td>
                    <td>@(e.EntryType == MoneyDiaryEntryType.Income ? "إيراد" : "مصروف")</td>
                    <td>@e.Amount.ToString("N0") @CurrencyHelper.GetSymbol(e.Currency)</td>
                    <td class="small">@(e.Description ?? "—")</td>
                </tr>
            }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
